[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[11B←  ☒ Producer \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Wages \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mNo wage amounts or batch lengths\u001b[36Gare authored, and\u001b[54Graw product\u001b[66Gon h\u001b[71Gs no recipe. How sho\u001b[92Gld W04 handle payroll?\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDaily batches, wage share\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEach production row\u001b[26Gis a batch of one day's output with an authored gross\u001b[80Gwage\u001b[85Gbill: a balance valu\u001b[106G, the output's \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bbase value\u001b[17Gtime\u001b[22G an auth\u001b[31Gred share (say 30%). Payr\u001b[57Gll, tax\u001b[65Gca\u001b[68Gry\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75Gthe condit\u001b[86Gon\u001b[89Gwork rate\u001b[99Gall apply to it.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mSplit: payroll later\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mW04 ships production, brokers, household buying and condition. Payroll and tax become W04b, so for now households \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Blive on their starting funds.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3. Type \u001b[12Gomething.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4. Chat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[16;1H"]
