[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[14C\u001b[11B ☒ Wages \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Households \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mH\u001b[5Gw do\u001b[10Gs a region's household pool buy its \u001b[47Gssentials (and op\u001b[68Gal goods, the venue'\u001b[89G `demand`\u001b[99Grows) when goods trade\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1min whole totes but each interval's need is fractional?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mThrough the book (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mE\u001b[8Gch\u001b[11Gturn the pool bids at the b\u001b[39Goker's\u001b[46Gask, in wh\u001b[58Ge totes, for\u001b[71Gwhat its pantry lacks.\u001b[94GIt then consumes the exact \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfractional need from a household pantry that keeps an opened tote's remainder. Same settlement path as a company.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mDirect, fractional\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe p\u001b[12Gol buys\u001b[20Gex\u001b[23Gc\u001b[25G fractional quantities straight from the broker's stock at its ask, outside the book. Simpler \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153maccounting, but a second settlement path beside the book.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3. Type something.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[17;1H"]
