[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've finished reading. The engine side\u001b[42Gneeds\u001b[48Gnothing.\u001b[57GManifest's\u001b[68Gplans\u001b[74Gleave\u001b[80Gseveral\u001b[88GW04\u001b[92Grules\u001b[98Gopen,\u001b[104Gthough,\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116Gthey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsay\u001b[7Gnot\u001b[11Gto\u001b[14Ginvent\u001b[21Gthem,\u001b[27Gso\u001b[30GI\u001b[32Gneed\u001b[37Gfour\u001b[42Gchoices\u001b[50Gfrom\u001b[55Gyou\u001b[59Gbefore\u001b[66GI\u001b[68Gwrite\u001b[74Gcode.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mWorking\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 1m 34s\u001b[39m…\u001b[21G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←\u001b[3G ☒ Producer  ☒ Wages\u001b[25G☒\u001b[27GHouseholds\u001b[38G\u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Trading fixture \u001b[58G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m✔\u001b[60GSubmit\u001b[68G→\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mThe eight-good trading fixture trades no grain, water or medical supplies, so its two regions could never meet a need.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhat should happen there?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNeed not required\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA need none of whose items the scenario trades is not required there. The trading fixture's regions keep their \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mcondition, and only the governance fixture exercises needs.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\