[0.037, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm reading the\u001b[19GManifes\u001b[28Geconomy plan's W04 rule\u001b[53G(house\u001b[60Golds,\u001b[66Gpayroll, condit\u001b[82Gon, production)\u001b[98Gto\u001b[101Gbuild\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gcapability\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmap.\u001b[8GNothing\u001b[16Ghas\u001b[20Gbeen\u001b[25Gchanged\u001b[33Gyet.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've\u001b[8Gfinished\u001b[17Greading.\u001b[26GThe\u001b[30Gengine\u001b[37Gside\u001b[42Gneeds\u001b[48Gnothing.\u001b[57GManifest's\u001b[68Gplans\u001b[74Gleave\u001b[80Gseveral\u001b[88GW04\u001b[92Grules\u001b[98Gopen,\u001b[104Gthough,\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116Gthey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsay not to invent them, so I need four\u001b[42Gchoices\u001b[50Gfrom\u001b[55Gyou\u001b[59Gbefore\u001b[66GI\u001b[68Gwrite\u001b[74Gcode.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDecline\u001b[11G to\u001b[15Ganswer Claude's questions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Who makes a venue's `production` rows (Ore's furs, Forge's grain), and who owns the output? (Regional employer \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B(Recommended) / The broker produces)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m·\u001b[8GNo wage amounts or batch lengths are authored, and raw production has no recipe. How should W04 handle payroll? \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B(Daily batches, wage share / Split: payroll later)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How does a region's household pool buy its essentials (and optional goods, the venue's `demand` rows) when goods \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mtrade in whole totes but each interval's need is fractional? (Through the book (Recommended) / Direct, fractional)\r\u001b[5C\u001