[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How does a region's household pool buy its essentials (and optional goods, the venue's `demand` rows) when goods \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mtrade\u001b[12Gin whole tot\u001b[25Gs but each \u001b[37Gnterval's ne\u001b[50Gd is fractional?\u001b[67G(Through the b\u001b[82Gok (Recommended) / Direct, fractional)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· The eight-good trading fixture trades no grain, water or medical supplies, so its two regions could never meet a \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bneed. What should\u001b[24Ghappen there? (Need not required /\u001b[59GAdd\u001b[63Gessentials\u001b[74G/ Let th\u001b[83Gm starve)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mYour first three answers are noted:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mProducer:\u001b[22m a regional employer per region, selling to the broker through the book.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWages:\u001b[22m daily batches, each with a wage bill that is an authored share of the output's value.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mHouseholds:\u001b[22m they buy whole totes through the book and consume the exact amount from a pantry.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GWhat\u001b[8Gwould\u001b[14Gyou like to cl\u001b[30Gify about\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gtrading\u001b[52Gfixture?\u001b[61GIts\u001b[65Gtwo\u001b[69Gregions\u001b[77G(Ore\u001b[82GHighlands\u001b[92Gand\u001b[96GBrine\u001b[102GCoast,\u001b[109G25,000\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpeople each) t\u001b[18Gade on\u001b[25Gy \u001b[28Getals,\u001b[35Gfu\u001b[38Gs, salt\u001b[47Glime, \u001b[54Glassware and soap. Without\u001b[81Ggrain,\u001b[88Gwater\u001b[94Gor\u001b[97Gmedical\u001b[105Gsupplies\u001b[114Gthey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan never meet\u001b[18Ga need.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 1m 59s · done 3:53 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThey need to also trade the essentials. I just wanted to confirm that this is for manifest and not the cut-down game \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthat astralis uses. Give them all the essentials as needs and trade goods.\u001b[39m                                            \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GConsidering… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Use /color and /rename to tell your sessions apart\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
