aches, which must be attached. The id\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;117;113;94mentities and the content must outlive the world. Throws\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m7\u001b[14G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;117;113;94mstd::invalid_argument for a content\u001b[50Gset with no scenario selected, or an order life or economic\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[2m8\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// interval that is not a whole number of the world's steps.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 69 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;166;226;46mvoid\u001b[16GRegister\u001b[38;2;253;151;31m(\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd ../manifest && cmake --build --preset clang-debug -j 24 2>&1 | grep -E \"error|warning: |FAILED\" | head -40\r\u001b[16C\u001b[2B8m 58s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m52.0k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
