[0.069, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 100 \u001b[22m `CargoVolume`, whose empty map was taken for none given; a hull the map does not name now carries\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 101 \u001b[22m nothing (`company`). Round 7 approved with no finding open.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m102\u001b[18G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 103 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m## W04: the regional economy — 2026-11-20                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 104 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 105 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mOn pin `54fb871`, with no engine edit. `manifest.economy` runs between the expiry sweep and the       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 106 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbrokers: each region's employer works its batches every step, and on a turn's last step pays the      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 107 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwages earned, sells to its broker, and its households buy and consume, their shortages moving health  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 108 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mand happiness ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mwhat it chose and its evidence\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#delivered-w04-2026-11-20)).   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 109 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe user chose a regional employer per region, day-long batches with a wage share, households buying  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 110 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhole totes through the book, and every region trading the essentials, which the 