[0.049, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAt the end of each 60-second turn\u001b[22m:\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Wages earned so far are paid, rounded down, with 10% withheld for the regional treasury.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Each employer offers everything it has made to its venue's broker at the broker's bid.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Households buy whole totes through the book, cheapest grain first. Their orders never rest on the book. They\u001b[116Gthen\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B consume exactly that minute's need from a pantry that keeps what's left of opened totes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Optional goods are bought only once every essential is met. Shortages are recorded, and health and happiness\u001b[116Gmove\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B with\u001b[12Gthem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBrokers\u001b[22m still bid only what\u001b[33Gtheir\u001b[39Gfunds\u001b[45Gcover.\u001b[52GNothing\u001b[60Grefills\u001b[68Gany\u001b[72Gaccount,\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gnothing\u001b[93Gmoves\u001b[99Ggoods\u001b[105Gbetween\u001b[113Gvenues.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mYour rule that every region trades the essentials\u001b[22m is \u001b[57Gow a cont\u001b[67Gn\u001b[69G check.\u001b[77GThe trading f\u001b[91Gxture gained grain, water\u001b[117Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmedical supp\u001b[16Gies on both\u001b[28Gplanets:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mOre\u001b[22m grows r\u001b[17Gce\u001b[24Goats.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBrine\u001b[22m grows wheat and barley and mak\u001b[42Gs the medical suppl\u001b[62Ges.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWater:\u001b[12G\u001b[22meach planet draw\u001b[29G it\u001b[34Gown.\u001b[39G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GSo Ore must import medical suppli\u001b[37Gs or its condition\u001b[56Gslips.\u001b[63GThe\u001b[67Ggovernance\u001b[78Gfixture's\u001b[88GCassiter\u001b[97Gdock\u001b[102Ggained\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gthree\r\u001b[1B  grains it lacked. Your choices are recorded as D-092.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTests.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mNew economy tests\u001b[22m cover\u001b[29Gthe work-rate table, severity and\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gcondition\u001b[77Gcurve\u001b[83G(100/100\u001b[92G→\u001b[94G94/88\u001b[100G→\u001b[102G97/94),\u001b[110Gthe\r\u001b[1B    100/90/10 wage split and the tax carry. They also run real\u001b[64Gbatches,\u001b[73Ghousehold\u001b[83Gbuying,\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gshortage\u001b[102Gat\u001b[105GOre\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Ga\u001b[115Gsave\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
