[0.541, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brepositories. The\u001b[21GManifest\u001b[30Ggate\u001b[35G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m)\u001b[60Gpasses\u001b[67Gwith\u001b[72Gall\u001b[76G45\u001b[79Gsuites\u001b[86Ggreen,\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97GJettison's\u001b[108GMarkdown\u001b[117Glink\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcheck\u001b[9Gis\u001b[12Gclean.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow the economy works now.\u001b[30G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[33Gis\u001b[36Ga\u001b[38Gnew\u001b[42Gsystem,\u001b[50G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.economy\u001b[39m,\u001b[68Gthat\u001b[73Gruns\u001b[78Gafter\u001b[84Gexpired\u001b[92Gorders\u001b[99Gare\u001b[103Gcleared\u001b[111Gand\u001b[115Gbefore\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe brokers requote:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEvery step\u001b[22m, each\u001b[22Gregion\u001b[31Gemployer work\u001b[46Gits\u001b[50Gbatches. A\u001b[61Gbatch is whole tot\u001b[80Gs, about a day's output,\u001b[105Gand its wage\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbill (30% of the\u001b[22Goutput's\u001b[31Gbase\u001b[36Gvalue)\u001b[43Gis\u001b[46Gset\u001b[50Gaside\u001b[56Gwhen\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gstarts.\u001b[72GWork\u001b[77Gspeeds\u001b[84Gup\u001b[87Gor\u001b[90Gslows\u001b[96Gwith\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gregion's\u001b[114Ghealth\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand happiness.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAt the end of each 60-second turn\u001b[22m:\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BW\u001b[9Gges earned s\u001b[22G \u001b[24Ga\u001b[26G are paid, rounded down,\u001b[51Gwith 10% withheld fo\u001b[73Gthe r\u001b[79Ggional treasury.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BEach employer offers\u001b[28Geverything it\u001b[42Ghas\u001b[46Gmade to its venue's broker at the\u001b[80Gb\u001b[82Goker's bid.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GH\u001b[9Gu\u001b[11Geholds buy whole\u001b[28Gtotes through\u001b[42Gthe book, cheapes\u001b[61Ggrain\u001b[67Gfirst.\u001b[74GTheir orders never rest\u001b[98Gon\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105G