[0.062, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCompany\u001b[13Gsuite's pinned hash:\u001b[22m i\u001b[36G didn't move. I expect that's because\u001b[74Gits\u001b[78Gworld\u001b[84Gtakes\u001b[90Gno\u001b[93Gbroker\u001b[100Gquotes\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Gnever\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Greaches a turn, but I haven't confirmed it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThis\u001b[8Gchange\u001b[15Gisn't\u001b[21Gcommitted\u001b[31Gyet.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat\u001b[8Gshould\u001b[15GI\u001b[17Gchange\u001b[24Gin\u001b[27G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/record-claude.sh\u001b[39m?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 5s · done 4:25 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mChanges I want:\u001b[39m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- fil\u001b[11Gare saved to this project, not in my home folder. Save them to ./asciinema/jettison-NNNN.cast\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BBe aware I made\u001b[21Ga change t\u001b[32G the filename stub, that is deliberate.\u001b[39m                                 \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAdjust the\u001b[16Gl\u001b[18Gunch\u001b[24Gommand for claud\u001b[41G so it passes in the nam\u001b[66G of the session using the -n parameter. The session \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bname i\u001b[10G the same as\u001b[23Gthe filename that a\u001b[43Gci\u001b[46Gnem\u001b[50G is recording int\u001b[68G.\u001b[70GT\u001b[72Gis ties the session\u001b[92Gto\u001b[95Gthe fil\u001b[103G for lat\u001b[112Gr \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mchecks.\u001b[39m                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u