[0.023, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've updated \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/record-claude.sh\u001b[39m; it passes \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mshellcheck\u001b[39m.\u001b[64GI\u001b[66Gtested\u001b[73Git\u001b[76Gwith\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gcopy\u001b[88Gwhose\u001b[94Gfinal\u001b[100G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249masciinema rec\u001b[114G\u001b[39monly\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprints the\u001b[14Gcommand instead of s\u001b[35Garting the recordi\u001b[54Gg, and it printed\u001b[72Gthis:\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249masciinema rec --command claude -n jettison-0002 --resume a\\ b  …/asciinema/jettison-0002.cast\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mLocation:\u001b[22m recordings now go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m./asciinema/jettison-NNNN.cast\u001b[39m in the repository root,\u001b[91Gnot\u001b[95Gyour\u001b[100Ghome\u001b[105Gfolder.\u001b[113GThe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnumbering counts only \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison-*\u001b[39m files there, so older \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclaude-*\u001b[39m recordings are ignored.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSession name:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclaude\u001b[39m is launched with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m-n jettison-NNNN\u001b[39m, so the session name matches its recording file.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mYour filename change:\u001b[22m the script on disk still had \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclaude-NNNN\u001b[39m when I read it, so I took the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison-\u001b[108G\u001b[39mprefix\u001b[115Gin\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Byour message to be that change. Tell me if you meant something else.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDecision\u001b[12Gfor\u001b[16Gyou:\u001b[21G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249masciinema/\u001b[32G\u001b[39misn't\u001b[38Gin\u001b[41G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.gitignore\u001b[39m,\u001b[53Gso\u001b[56Grecordings\u001b[67Gwill\u001b[72Gappear\u001b[79Gas\u001b[82Guntracked\u001b[92Gfiles\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Gcould\u001b[108Gget\u001b[112Gcommitted\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gby a\u001b[8Gc\u001b[10Gdent. Shall I add\u001b[28Git?\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe script change and the water price change are both uncommitted. The Manifest gate passed for the water price; this\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchange is Jettison-only, and I haven't run Jettison's gate for it.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
